	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"カスタマイズの幅を広げる30MM「エグザビークルシリーズ」にアタックサブマリンVer.が登場！",
			"• パーツの組み替えでエイ型、ノコギリザメ型、シュモクザメ型の３形態に変形。",
			"• 各機体のバックパックとしても使用可能。",
			"• 分解すればカスタマイズパーツとしても使える。"
		],
		"en": [
			"Attack Submarine Ver. is now available in the 30MM \"Exa Vehicle Series\" that expands the range of customization!",
			"• By rearranging the parts, it transforms into three forms: ray-shaped, saw-shark-shaped, and hammerhead-shaped.",
			"• Can also be used as a backpack for each aircraft.",
			"• If you disassemble it, it can be used as a customized part."
		]
